<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>创建快照 - Conda环境快照管理系统</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Conda环境快照管理系统</h1>
            <div class="user-info">
                <span>当前用户: <%= user.username %></span>
                <a href="/logout" class="logout">退出登录</a>
            </div>
        </header>
        
        <nav>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/view">查询快照</a></li>
                <li><a href="/report" class="active">创建快照</a></li>
                <li><a href="/history">快照历史</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        
        <main>
            <h2>创建环境快照</h2>
            <p>在Linux终端的conda环境中运行 <code>conda list</code>，复制环境列表（从包列表开始，不包含注释行）到下方文本框。</p>
            
            <form action="/report" method="post">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="environmentName">环境名称 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="environmentName" name="environmentName" required placeholder="如: base, py38">
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="environmentType">环境类型 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <select id="environmentType" name="environmentType" required>
                        <option value="">请选择类型</option>
                        <option value="正式环境">正式环境</option>
                        <option value="预览环境">预览环境</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="description">描述:</label>
                    <textarea id="description" name="description" rows="3" placeholder="可选：描述此环境的用途、特点等"></textarea>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="rawText">Conda环境列表 <span class="required">*</span>:</label>
                    <textarea id="rawText" name="rawText" rows="15" required placeholder="粘贴conda list命令的输出结果（从包列表开始，不包含注释行）"></textarea>
                    <p class="hint">示例：
                        <pre>_libgcc_mutex 0.1 main
_openmp_mutex 5.1 1_gnu
anaconda-anon-usage 0.7.1 py313hfc0e8ea_100
annotated-types 0.6.0 py313h06a4308_0</pre>
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="form-group">
                    <button type="submit">创建快照</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>